# I adds a first child and i a last child of the focused block, at once, so the letters typed after them are the new blocks' text.
file <<END
Project:
	- Task one
END
see Task one
keys I
type first
keys <Esc> k ip
type roj
keys <Esc>
see - proj
quit
saved <<END
Project:
	- first
	- Task one
	- proj
END
